      "comment": "REOFFENDER (8) is a talented gelding who has managed four wins and three minor placings from seven starts this campaign. Made it two wins in a row at his latest appearance, scoring by 6.6 metres after taking the lead a long way from home. Switches to the standing start but has won under those conditions before. Can go close again. MAJESTIC SUMMER (2) has been enjoying the standing starts of late, winning two of her last three here. Scored from the front mark last week and starts from there again. Big chance. CARLA PIXIE NZ (7) broke following interference here last start but had recorded a string of placings at Melton prior and won the only other time she raced here so give her another chance. DAISY BOUCHEA (4) added to a series of top-four results despite locking wheels and breaking last week. Can be competitive again.",
